{"id":"wb-7-1022","name":"余庆堂","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"余庆堂","text":"余庆堂位于浙江省金华市兰溪市女埠街道渡渎村渡一行政村。建筑建于明洪武年间，面西向，平面布局为三进一穿堂，堂前尚存一对明代石狮，建筑总面积约860平方米。2005年3月16日公布为浙江省文物保护单位，2013年5月公布为第七批全国重点文物保护单位。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E4%BD%99%E5%BA%86%E5%A0%82","revisionId":90056402,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=90056402","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/ea07f1d92b078920d3b484d6.jpg","title":"Lanxi_Dudu_2025.10.17_14-55-28.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Lanxi_Dudu_2025.10.17_14-55-28.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/e/e1/Lanxi_Dudu_2025.10.17_14-55-28.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Zhangzhugang","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"​兰溪市渡渎余庆堂","width":320,"height":240}}